            "is_free": false,
            "detailed_description": "<h1>Coming Soon</h1><p>Night Level - Coming Soon!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701370/extras/Homing_Mines!_(1).JPG?t=1512172401\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/701370/extras/Subs_1.JPG?t=1512172401\" /></span></p><br><h1>Acerca do jogo</h1>War. War never changes… Except for that one time flying pirates assaulted your village with deadly party balloons, exploding toy boats, and other adorable things capable of vaporizing your skin parts.<br><br>“Time to grab the ol’ bow and a barrel of arrows,” you said. <br><br>Good call!<br><br>Survive wave after wave of BOOM in this zany and surprisingly addictive First Person POPPER.  <br><br>-\tTrain and unlock single-use weapons and traps<br>-\tUpgrade your defenses<br>-\tHit streaks for exploding rewards!<br>-\tTest your reflexes with mini games!<br>-       Hours and hours of game play!",
